//! Behavior system module root for the TML self-hosting type checker.
//!
//! Re-exports the core behavior types and functions.
//! Named `common.tml` because `mod` is a reserved keyword in TML.
//! Directory named `behaviors` (plural) because `behavior` is also reserved.
//!
//! Phase 14d — item 1.1.

